Cost residuals are diagnosed per transaction even when their sum is zero.

========== API ==========

balanceHistoryReport({ valuation: 'cost', dateBasis: 'transaction' })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity FUND
  format 1,000.000 FUND
account Assets:Fund
account Assets:Cash

2024-01-01 First purchase
  Assets:Fund  3 FUND {33.33 SEK}
  Assets:Cash  -100 SEK

2024-01-01 Second purchase
  Assets:Fund  3 FUND {66.67 SEK}
  Assets:Cash  -200 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "date": "2024-01-01",
    "amount": "0",
    "commodity": "SEK"
  }
]

========== WARNINGS ==========

[UNBALANCED_TRANSACTION] Transaction does not balance: -0.01 SEK
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:9:1

[UNBALANCED_TRANSACTION] Transaction does not balance: 0.01 SEK
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:13:1

[COST_BALANCE_MISMATCH] Transaction cost balance is -0.01 SEK; the balance and balance-history reports at cost using transaction dates require zero
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:9:1

[COST_BALANCE_MISMATCH] Transaction cost balance is 0.01 SEK; the balance and balance-history reports at cost using transaction dates require zero
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:13:1
